  dialogue: "Funny thing, I got two emails today both saying \u2018document update.\u2019
    One had a PDF, the other had an EXE."
  firstChoice: "Both are fine. Just open whichever\u2019s faster."
  secondChoice: The PDF is safer, but scan both anyway.
  firstChoiceResponse: That sounds reckless. The EXE could be a trap.
  secondChoiceResponse: True. A quick scan is worth the extra minute.
